ot"},{"text":"வீசு","lemma":"வீசு","gloss":"to distribute/throw"}],"gloss":"chariot-distributing"},{"surface":"இருக்கை","parts":[{"text":"இருக்கை","lemma":"இருக்கை","gloss":"seat/assembly"}],"gloss":"seat"},{"surface":"ஆர","parts":[{"text":"ஆர","lemma":"ஆர","gloss":"fully/closely"}],"gloss":"fully"},{"surface":"நோக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நோக்கி","lemma":"நோக்கு","gloss":"having looked"}],"gloss":"looking at"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"அவற்","parts":[{"text":"அவற்","lemma":"அவற்","gloss":"him"}],"gloss":"him","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்ட","parts":[{"text":"கண்ட","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"seen"}],"gloss":"after seeing"},{"surface":"பின்றைப்","parts":[{"text":"பின்றை","lemma":"பின்றை","gloss":"afterwards"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"increment"}],"gloss":"afterwards"},{"surface":"பூவின்","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like a flower"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆடுவண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"ஆடு","gloss":"moving/dancing"},{"text":"வண்டு","lemma":"வண்டு","gloss":"bee"}],"gloss":"moving bees"},{"surface":"இமிராத்","parts":[{"text":"இமிராத்","lemma":"இமிராத்","gloss":"on which bees do not hum"}],"gloss":"on which bees do not hum","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தாமரை","parts":[{"text":"தாமரை","lemma":"தாமரை","gloss":"lotus (golden lotus ornament)"}],"gloss":"golden lotus"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சூடாய்","parts":[{"text":"சூடு","lemma":"சூடு","gloss":"to wear"},{"text":"ஆய்","lemma":"ஆய்","gloss":"you will"}],"gloss":"you will wear"},{"surface":"ஆதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆதல்","lemma":"ஆதல்","gloss":"becoming"}],"gloss":"surely"},{"surface":"அதனினும்","parts":[{"text":"அதனினும்","lemma":"அதனினும்","gloss":"more than that"}],"gloss":"more than that","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இலையே","parts":[{"text":"இலை","lemma":"இலை","gloss":"not there"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"there is no doubt indeed"}]}],"literal":"In your hand is the duty-bound, full-toned lute; on your body, / because of the absence of patrons, is hunger; on your waist, / sweat-soaked ragged clothes sewn with different threads, / O suffering bard who wears them with care! / Like the body of one who has no determination, / with your large, great kinfolk who are in great poverty, / if you ask me gently, having surrounded the entire world: / 'Who is my patron?' / In the war camp with banners where slaying male elephants suffer, / having destroyed the tusked elephants in the expanse of blood, / he of the army that made a battlefield smelling of flesh, / is in Uraiyur with high-standing mansions. / He is also fit to march to the enemy's land with his spear raised high for warriors; / if you go to Killi Valavan who wears a beautiful garland / and bright golden ornaments resembling a brilliant fire, / you will not have to stand at his long gate; in the intense day, / looking fully at his seat where he distributes chariots, / after you have seen him, a lotus / on which humming bees do not buzz, / you will surely wear; there is no doubt about that.","translation":"O suffering bard, who carefully wears sweat-soaked rags patched with different threads around your waist, with hunger on your body due to the lack of patrons, and a well-tuned lute in your hand! If you, along with your large family in deep poverty—like the body of a man without determination—gently ask me, after wandering the entire world, 'Who is our protector?' He is in Uraiyur, a city of high mansions. He has a clamorous army that turned the battlefield into a flesh-smelling ground, destroying tusked elephants in an expanse of blood in the war camp of banners where war-elephants suffer. He, with his spear raised high for his warriors, is capable of marching into the enemy's territory. If you go to Killi Valavan, who wears a beautiful garland and bright golden ornaments that resemble a blazing fire, you will not have to wait at his tall gates. Looking closely at his seat where he generously gives away chariots even during the hot midday, once you see him, you will surely wear a golden lotus on which no bees hum. There is no doubt about that.","modern":"கையில் தாளம் தப்பாத யாழுடனும், வள்ளல்கள் இல்லாததால் உடம்பில் பசியுடனும், இடுப்பில் வேறு நூல்களால் தைக்கப்பட்ட வேர்வைய நனைந்த கந்தல் துணியை கவனமாக உடுத்தியிருக்கும் துன்புறும் பாணனே! ஊக்கம் இல்லாதவனுடைய உடம்பைப் போல வறுமையில் வாடும் உன்னுடைய பெரிய சுற்றத்தாருடன், உலகம் முழுவதையும் சுற்றி வந்து என்னிடம் மெதுவாக, 'எம்மைப் பாதுகாப்பவர் யார்?' என்று கேட்பாயானால்: போர்க்களத்தில் கொடிகள் அசையும் பாசறையில், பகைவர்களின் தந்தங்களைக் கொண்ட யானைகளைக் கொன்று, குருதி வெள்ளத்தில் பிணக்காடாக்கிய ஆரவாரமான படையை உடையவன், உயர்ந்த மாடங்களைக் கொண்ட உறையூரில் இருக்கும் சோழன் கிள்ளிவளவன் ஆவான். அவன் தன் வீரர்களுக்காக வேலேந்திப் பகைவர் நாட்டுக்குச் செல்லவும் வல்லவன். அழகிய மாலையையும், எரியும் நெருப்பைப் போன்ற பொன்னணிகளையும் அணிந்த கிள்ளிவளவனிடம் நீ சென்றால், அவனுடைய நீண்ட வாயிலில் நீ காத்து நிற்க வேண்டியதில்லை. நண்பகலிலும் தேர்களை வாரி வழங்கும் அவனது கொடை இருக்கையைக் கண்டு, நீ அவனைக் கண்ட பிறகு, வண்டுகள் மொய்க்காத பொற்றாமரைப் பூவைச் சூடுவாய் என்பது உறுதி.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Purattinai category of Padan, specifically the theme of Panarruppadai (guiding a bard to a patron). The poet Alanthur Kizhar addresses a starving bard who is wandering with his impoverished family. The poet describes the bard's miserable state—wearing sweat-soaked, patched rags and carrying a lute—and directs him to the Chola king Killi Valavan of Uraiyur. The king is described both as a fierce warrior who turns battlefields into bloodbaths and as an incredibly generous patron who gives away chariots even during the hot midday. The poet assures the bard that once he meets the king, he will not have to wait at the gates and will surely receive a golden lotus ornament (a traditional royal gift to bards), ending his poverty forever.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,4.21],[4.47,4.6],[4.6,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.6],[6.6,7.7],[7.7,7.8],[7.8,7.8],[7.8,8.4],[8.7,9.7],[9.7,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.76],[10.94,11.21],[11.3,11.6],[11.6,11.8],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,13.3],[13.3,13.5],[13.9,14.34],[14.34,14.4],[14.4,15.0],[15.0,15.4],[15.4,15.6],[15.6,15.9],[16.92,17.62],[17.62,18.02],[18.02,18.12],[18.12,18.52],[18.52,20.02],[20.02,20.22],[20.22,20.52],[20.52,20.52],[20.52,20.81],[20.81,20.81],[20.81,20.81],[20.81,21.39],[21.39,23.72],[23.72,24.32],[24.32,24.42],[24.42,24.62],[24.62,25.12],[25.12,25.52],[25.52,26.62],[26.62,26.72],[26.72,27.12],[27.12,27.42],[27.42,27.72],[27.72,28.32],[28.32,28.92],[28.92,29.32],[29.32,29.72],[29.72,30.02],[30.02,30.12],[30.12,31.12],[31.12,31.22],[31.22,31.72],[31.72,32.52],[32.52,33.01],[33.01,33.26],[33.26,33.26],[33.26,33.42],[35.12,35.62],[35.62,35.92],[35.92,36.02],[36.02,36.62],[36.62,36.82],[36.82,37.12],[37.12,38.02],[38.02,38.12],[38.12,38.72],[38.72,38.82],[38.82,39.92],[39.92,40.22],[40.22,40.62],[40.62,40.62],[40.62,41.22],[41.22,41.92],[41.92,42.32],[42.32,42.82],[42.82,43.82],[43.82,43.92],[43.92,44.32],[44.32,44.92]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.2],[3.2,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,5.0],[5.6,5.9],[5.9,7.23],[7.23,7.23],[7.23,7.8],[7.8,8.3],[8.3,8.4],[8.4,9.19],[9.19,9.34],[9.5,10.6],[10.6,10.7],[10.7,11.2],[11.2,11.6],[11.6,12.62],[12.73,12.9],[12.9,13.2],[13.2,13.3],[13.3,13.9],[13.9,15.1],[15.1,15.26],[15.28,15.3],[15.3,16.4],[16.4,17.1],[17.1,17.5],[17.5,17.6],[17.6,18.0],[19.08,19.88],[19.88,20.28],[20.28,20.38],[20.38,20.88],[20.88,22.38],[22.38,22.58],[22.58,22.78],[22.96,23.48],[23.48,23.48],[23.48,23.48],[23.48,25.38],[25.38,25.93],[25.93,26.28],[26.28,27.18],[27.18,27.38],[27.38,27.88],[27.88,28.08],[28.08,28.48],[28.48,29.78],[29.78,29.98],[29.98,30.48],[30.48,30.88],[30.88,31.08],[31.08,31.83],[31.83,32.58],[32.58,33.08],[33.15,33.48],